[ti:45. The Boss's Letter]
[by:Generated by iChochy]

[00:00.670]Lesson 45. | 第45课。
[00:03.160]Can you come here a minute /ˈmɪnɪt/, please, Bob? | 鲍勃，你能过来一下吗？
[00:06.400]Yes, sir. | 是的，先生。
[00:08.630]Where's Miss Jones? | 琼斯小姐在哪儿？
[00:10.970]She's next door. | 她在隔壁。
[00:13.060]She's in her office, sir. | 她在办公室里，先生。
[00:14.930]Can she type /taɪp/ this letter /ˈletə/ for me? | 她能帮我打这封信吗？
[00:18.560]Ask /ɑːsk/ her, please. | 请问一下她。
[00:20.120]Yes, sir. | 是的，先生。
[00:23.020]Can you type /taɪp/ this letter /ˈletə/ for the boss /bɒs/, please, Miss Jones? | 琼斯小姐，你能帮老板打这封信吗？
[00:26.700]Yes, of course I can. | 是的，当然可以。
[00:29.740]Here you are. | 给你。
[00:30.940]Thank you, Bob. | 谢谢你，鲍勃。
[00:33.390]Bob! | 鲍勃！
[00:34.470]Yes? What's the matter? | 是的？怎么了？
[00:36.570]I can't type /taɪp/ this letter /ˈletə/. | 我打不了这封信。
[00:40.400]I can't read it. | 我看不懂。
[00:42.360]The boss /bɒs/'s handwriting /ˈhændraɪtɪŋ/ is terrible /ˈterəbl/. | 老板的笔迹太糟糕了。